// R53 跨环境华丽度：局部灯独立生成珠光轮廓，平行光只补偿可读材质大面。
#include "/Plugin/Ue5MMDTools/TMMDShader/MMDUniversalAnimeToonR52.usf"

struct TMMDUniversalAnimeToonR53
{
    float3 ComputeJewelRim(TMMDUniversalAnimeToonR25 base_toon,
                           Texture2D light_data_tex,
                           SamplerState light_data_tex_sampler,
                           float3 world_pos,
                           float3 shading_normal,
                           float3 view_direction,
                           out float directional_presence)
    {
        directional_presence = 0.0;
        float silhouette = saturate(1.0 - dot(shading_normal, view_direction));
        float broad_rim = smoothstep(0.52, 0.90, silhouette);
        float core_rim = smoothstep(0.86, 0.975, silhouette);
        float3 rim_sum = 0.0;

        [unroll]
        for (int i = 0; i < 16; ++i)
        {
            float4 P;
            float4 C;
            float4 D;
            float4 T;
            base_toon.SampleLight(light_data_tex, light_data_tex_sampler, i, P, C, D, T);
            if (P.w >= 0.5)
            {
                float3 L;
                float attenuation;
                base_toon.LightParams(P, D, T, world_pos, L, attenuation);
                float energy = (1.0 - exp(-max(C.w, 0.0) * 0.34)) * attenuation;
                bool is_directional = P.w >= 2.5 && P.w < 3.5;
                if (is_directional)
                {
                    directional_presence = max(directional_presence, energy);
                }
                else
                {
                    float color_max = max(max(C.r, C.g), max(C.b, 0.001));
                    float3 light_hue = max(C.rgb, 0.0) / color_max;
                    float backlight = smoothstep(-0.12, 0.68, -dot(L, view_direction));
                    float grazing = smoothstep(-0.42, 0.24, dot(shading_normal, L));
                    rim_sum += light_hue * energy * backlight *
                               (broad_rim * 0.72 + core_rim * 0.92) *
                               lerp(0.62, 1.0, grazing);
                }
            }
        }

        return 1.0 - exp(-rim_sum * 1.42);
    }

    float3 OutputColor(FMaterialPixelParameters Parameters,
                       float3 base_color,
                       Texture2D light_data_tex,
                       SamplerState light_data_tex_sampler,
                       float shadow_step,
                       float shadow_softness,
                       float shadow_strength,
                       float ambient_strength,
                       float light_color_influence,
                       float highlight_step,
                       float highlight_strength,
                       float rim_strength,
                       float rim_power,
                       float local_light_strength,
                       float local_specular_strength,
                       float glamour_rim_strength,
                       float directional_sheen_strength,
                       float surface_profile,
                       float3 base_texture_color,
                       float3 diffuse_color)
    {
        TMMDUniversalAnimeToonR52 layered_toon;
        float3 shaded_color = layered_toon.OutputColor(
            Parameters,
            base_color,
            light_data_tex,
            light_data_tex_sampler,
            shadow_step,
            shadow_softness,
            shadow_strength,
            ambient_strength,
            light_color_influence,
            highlight_step,
            highlight_strength,
            rim_strength,
            rim_power,
            local_light_strength,
            local_specular_strength,
            glamour_rim_strength,
            directional_sheen_strength,
            surface_profile,
            base_texture_color,
            diffuse_color
        );

        TMMDUniversalAnimeToonR25 base_toon;
        float profile_skin = 1.0 - step(0.5, abs(surface_profile - 1.0));
        float profile_hair = 1.0 - step(0.5, abs(surface_profile - 2.0));
        float profile_white_cloth = 1.0 - step(0.5, abs(surface_profile - 3.0));
        float profile_black_satin = 1.0 - step(0.5, abs(surface_profile - 4.0));
        float profile_hair_shadow = 1.0 - step(0.5, abs(surface_profile - 6.0));

        float diffuse_max = max(max(diffuse_color.r, diffuse_color.g), diffuse_color.b);
        float3 safe_diffuse = diffuse_max > 0.001 ? max(diffuse_color, 0.0) :
                              float3(1.0, 1.0, 1.0);
        float3 source_color = max(base_texture_color, 0.0) * safe_diffuse;

        float3 world_pos = LWCToFloat(Parameters.AbsoluteWorldPosition);
        float3 world_normal = base_toon.SafeNormalize((float3)Parameters.TangentToWorld[2],
                                                      float3(0.0, 0.0, 1.0));
        float3 view_direction = base_toon.SafeNormalize(
            LWCToFloat(GetWorldCameraOrigin(Parameters)) - world_pos,
            float3(0.0, 0.0, 1.0));
        float view_sign = dot(world_normal, view_direction) >= 0.0 ? 1.0 : -1.0;
        float3 shading_normal = world_normal * view_sign;
        float n_dot_v = saturate(dot(shading_normal, view_direction));

        float directional_presence;
        float3 jewel_rim = ComputeJewelRim(
            base_toon,
            light_data_tex,
            light_data_tex_sampler,
            world_pos,
            shading_normal,
            view_direction,
            directional_presence
        );

        float readable_profile = profile_skin * 0.68 +
                                 profile_white_cloth * 0.82 +
                                 profile_hair * 0.32;
        float directional_boost = 1.0 + directional_presence * readable_profile * 0.22;
        shaded_color *= directional_boost;

        float skin_front = smoothstep(0.30, 0.86, n_dot_v);
        float3 skin_warm = source_color * float3(1.045, 0.965, 0.945) +
                           float3(0.012, 0.003, 0.002);
        shaded_color = lerp(shaded_color,
                            max(shaded_color, skin_warm * 0.68),
                            profile_skin * skin_front * 0.54);

        float rim_gain = 0.24 + profile_hair * 0.76 +
                         profile_white_cloth * 0.58 +
                         profile_black_satin * 0.84 -
                         profile_skin * 0.12 -
                         profile_hair_shadow * 0.24;
        shaded_color += pow(max(jewel_rim, 0.0), 0.70) *
                        max(rim_gain, 0.0) * 0.62;

        return min(max(shaded_color, 0.0), 3.50);
    }
};
